        "कृपादृष्टी पाहे माझ्या पंढरीराया ॥ ४ ॥"
      ],
      "transliteratedLines": [
        "Aso Naso Bhava Amhan Tujhiya Thaya",
        "Krupadrushti Pahe Majhya Pandhariraya ॥ 4 ॥"
